      <!-- Section: Lineage -->
              <div id="lineage" class="section metadataSection">
            <div class="section__header sh">
    <h2 class="sh__main">Lineage</h2>
            </div>
          <div class="section__content">
                        <table class="name-value-table">
                                          </table>

                          <h3 class="record-block-section-header">Sources</h3>
                              <!-- Record ID: 1389701, Created By: jesse.brass@noaa.gov (20144), 2025-05-14 18:02+0000, Last Mod By: jesse.brass@noaa.gov (20144), 2025-05-14 18:38+0000 -->
                <div class="record-block">
                  <div class="record-block-header cf">
                    <h3 class="left force-break">U.S. Coast Guard Navigation Center</h3>
                    <div class="x-small right">CC ID: 1389701</div>
                  </div>
                  <table class="name-value-table">
                                                                                                  <tr>
    <th scope="col">
              Publish Date:
          </th>
    <td class="ellipsisize">
              2025-01-01
          </td>
  </tr>
                                                                                                                                                                                              <tr>
    <th scope="col">Source Contribution:</th>
    <td class="small">
            <p>Daily compressed log files containing original AIS messages in NMEA format for the months of January through December for the United States</p>
      </td>
  </tr>
                    </table>
                </div>
                          
                          <h3 class="record-block-section-header">Process Steps</h3>
                              <!-- ${esc.html($processStep.recordDetail.displayString)} -->
                <div class="record-block">
                  <div class="record-block-header cf">
                    <h3 class="left">Process Step 1</h3>
                    <div class="x-small right">CC ID: 1389702</div>
                  </div>
                  <table class="name-value-table">
                        <tr>
    <th scope="col">Description:</th>
    <td class="small">
            <p>1. Filter the raw NMEA data to a one-minute sample rate and select a subset of fields using Marine Cadastre NMEA to SQL Server processing tools</p>
      <p>2. Load filtered records to an SQL Server 2024 database using MarineCadastre.gov NMEA to SQL Server processing tools</p>
      <p>3. Conduct quality and completeness check using logging results from the filter and loading process</p>
      <p>4. Update the VesselType, Length, Width, and Draft from United States Coast Guard AVIS where original AIS values are missing</p>
      <p>5. Add a new vessel type code to each record fragment that originated from the United States Coast Guard AVIS</p>
      <p>6. Develop track line features directly from the SQL Server database using a customize version of the Marine Cadastre Track Builder 3.1 (64-bit version) for each month of broadcast records and for each ocean basin, using a filter setting of 30 minutes and 1 mile</p>
      <p>7. Add field for vessel type group and populate based on the vessel type code to vessel group mapping described in attribute metadata</p>
      <p>8. Add field for track line duration, and calculate the time in minutes between the start and end time for each track feature</p>
      <p>9. Perform visual quality and consistency checks, and remove vessel tracks that are clearly invalid (on land) or beyond the ocean basin</p>
      <p>10. REPAIR GEOMETRY to correct features with null geometry, self intersections, and other errors</p>
      </td>
  </tr>
                            <tr>
    <th scope="col">
              Process Date/Time:
          </th>
    <td class="ellipsisize">
              2025-03-01 00:00:00
          </td>
  </tr>
                                                                                                                    </table>
                </div>
                                    </div>
        </div> <!-- .section Lineage -->
      
